{"unit_id":"CelineHuangdz__dsh-wait-buddy#card-zh","repo":"CelineHuangdz/dsh-wait-buddy","commit":"ad37f417be193606f2485fa2c8b2a70e1b1e80c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"WaitBuddy 是面向 DSH Web 会话视图的插件，在会话标签中加入 WaitBuddy 面板。它读取会话投影，展示任务状态、已完成步数和最近的命令或工具活动，并在等待审批或任务失败时显示提醒。面板还提供贪吃蛇和五子棋；审批、步骤和任务结束信号可暂停游戏或更新分数。适合需要观察长时间运行任务并在等待时进行轻量游戏的用户。没有代码声明的 API 密钥或外部服务要求。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-4","index.js:176-225","client.js:1923-1935","client.js:2178-2198"]}
{"unit_id":"CelineHuangdz__dsh-wait-buddy#card-en","repo":"CelineHuangdz/dsh-wait-buddy","commit":"ad37f417be193606f2485fa2c8b2a70e1b1e80c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"WaitBuddy adds a DSH Web session panel showing task status, completed steps, recent tool activity, and approval or failure alerts. It also offers Snake and Gomoku; agent events can pause a game and update its score. Useful when monitoring long-running tasks.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-4","index.js:176-225","client.js:1923-1935","client.js:2178-2198"]}
