{"unit_id":"CelineHuangdz__dsh-wait-buddy#feature-1","repo":"CelineHuangdz/dsh-wait-buddy","commit":"ad37f417be193606f2485fa2c8b2a70e1b1e80c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"WaitBuddy 的功能「会话任务监看」：在会话视图显示运行、成功、失败或中断状态、已完成步数及最近三条命令或工具活动，并提示待审批和失败任务。打开当前会话的 WaitBuddy 标签即可查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:176-225","client.js:2030-2159","client.js:1923-1935"]}
{"unit_id":"CelineHuangdz__dsh-wait-buddy#feature-2","repo":"CelineHuangdz/dsh-wait-buddy","commit":"ad37f417be193606f2485fa2c8b2a70e1b1e80c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"WaitBuddy 的功能「等待小游戏」：在面板中玩贪吃蛇或五子棋；贪吃蛇可调速度，五子棋可选难度。审批到来时游戏自动暂停，步骤与成功信号会带来分数变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1016-1040","client.js:1677-1915"]}
